{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15107450","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15107450","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1510745001:0":{"text":"ネフィル！狩猟神様……！ホーリンの奴らが森の中に……！","source_cn":"那……那非！狩猎神大人……！有人……有呼临人潜入了森林！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC4F847F3E1A4A45F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ネフィル！狩猟神様……！ホーリンの奴らが森の中に……！","female":"ネフィル！狩猟神様……！ホーリンの奴らが森の中に……！","variant_male_record_index":"180204","variant_female_record_index":"180205","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510745002:1":{"text":"相手は何人だ？いつ、どの方角へ向かった！？","source_cn":"有几人？多久之前，朝哪个方向去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEAE496DB8D438F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510745003:1":{"text":"最初は、四五人だけだったんだが……草むらに身を隠して、不意打ちを受けたんだ……！","source_cn":"最开始只有四五个……他们藏在草丛里，趁我们不备才得手……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1385A9DB31096B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510745004:1":{"text":"そいつらがいなくなった後、野営地の方から開戦の角笛が聞こえて……しばらくしたら、大勢の人間がここを通って行った。俺は、なんとか仲間を引きずってここに隠れたんだが……","source_cn":"他们离开之后，逐影营地那边传来开战的号角声……后来又有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE067B41039B83AA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510745005:1":{"text":"奴らは<style=\"highlight\">神殿の方へ向かった</style>……","source_cn":"他们都<style=highlight>朝着狩猎神殿的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D54334FE53B68A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510745006:1":{"text":"……前もって奇襲を仕掛けていたのか。最初から神殿を狙うつもりだったんだな。","source_cn":"……看来呼临人提前伏击了这条路上的守卫。他们早有预谋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F8D6178C3CE45A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510745007:0":{"text":"ネフィル……野営地は無事か？何かあったのか？","source_cn":"那非……逐影营地还好吗，是不是出了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x886F8AC25F6DC8DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510745008:0":{"text":"ホーリンの襲撃を受けたが、返り討ちにした。大勢で通り過ぎた奴らがそうだ。おれたちはそいつらを追ってきたんだ。","source_cn":"呼临人的进攻失败了。你第二次看到的那些人就是在逃跑，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEE71596254EBE40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510745009:0":{"text":"傷はそこまで酷くありません。止血しましたので、野営地に戻って休んでください。","source_cn":"你的伤势不重。我为你止住了血，快回营地养伤吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB49DB43CA68B88E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士坚蹄":{"text":"戦士のガンティー","source":"战士坚蹄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:那非":{"text":"ネフィル","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉